WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:05.997
Learn to determine the lowest common multiple (lcm) of at least any two given numbers

00:00:05.997 --> 00:00:10.248
up to 100 and recognise the relationship between factors and multiples

00:00:11.117 --> 00:00:18.512
Find the lowest common multiple (LCM) of 8 and 13. The answer is 104. 104 is the

00:00:18.512 --> 00:00:21.122
smallest positive multiple of both numbers.

00:00:21.950 --> 00:00:27.048
A bell rings every 4 minutes and a drum every 5 minutes. Starting together, after how

00:00:27.048 --> 00:00:31.827
many minutes will they next sound together? Pause and solve it in your exercise book.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:36.924
The answer is 20. Find LCM(4, 5) equals 20.
